{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Hi Deb! How're you? I've been busy. My engineering professor gave us a huge robotics project. It's tough but fun, it's making me get creative and problem-solve."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_3-74eecec79a5fa8ea65f9b12b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:58:32.885824+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "74eecec79a5fa8ea65f9b12b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "74eecec79a5fa8ea65f9b12b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Hey Jolene! It's great to hear from you. It sounds challenging but interesting! It must be really putting your creative and problem-solving skills to the test. How did you feel when you first received the project? Are you enjoying working on it?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_3-f96ca13e08b513a725c7cb36", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:58:32.909445+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f96ca13e08b513a725c7cb36", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f96ca13e08b513a725c7cb36", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: When I got it, I felt a mix of emotions - excited and nervous. But now, I'm really enjoying it! It's like trying to solve a puzzle, figuring out the best design and programming. Seeing the robot come together is awesome too!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_3-38843380d38c303c6541d30b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:58:32.924084+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "38843380d38c303c6541d30b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "38843380d38c303c6541d30b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: That's awesome, Jolene! You're enjoying the process. It must be really satisfying to see it come together. Keep up the good work! Oh, by the way, I met my new neighbor Anna yesterday!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_3-3a9fc3ce78cd7bfcd43b3035", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:58:32.939388+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3a9fc3ce78cd7bfcd43b3035", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3a9fc3ce78cd7bfcd43b3035", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: How did you two meet?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_3-6333a58697ad0d1a1b9e56c5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:58:32.956975+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6333a58697ad0d1a1b9e56c5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6333a58697ad0d1a1b9e56c5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: It happened at yoga in the park."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_3-2b9d1e89578f54b2f45c0c88", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:58:32.971408+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2b9d1e89578f54b2f45c0c88", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2b9d1e89578f54b2f45c0c88", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Wow, that's awesome! It's great connecting with people who have similar interests. Did you two talk about it?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_3-9480a97885b907b95fa93edd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:58:32.986982+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9480a97885b907b95fa93edd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9480a97885b907b95fa93edd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Yeah, we talked about how it has improved our lives and the sense of community it gives."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_3-2cc79262197afc5cd948c67b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:58:33.001971+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2cc79262197afc5cd948c67b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2cc79262197afc5cd948c67b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Sounds great!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_3-91379bc6d461b5515d3f13de", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:58:33.013826+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "91379bc6d461b5515d3f13de", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "91379bc6d461b5515d3f13de", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Have you ever thought about resuming yoga?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_3-e2eae114294ac4ea6b589401", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:58:33.027702+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e2eae114294ac4ea6b589401", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e2eae114294ac4ea6b589401", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Well... we planned to play the console with my partner."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_3-41aa1ab868ec67bf8952acb7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:58:33.042870+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "41aa1ab868ec67bf8952acb7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "41aa1ab868ec67bf8952acb7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: It's also good that you have something to do together."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_3-1fcf9f6f335b046d93604c76", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:58:33.053386+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1fcf9f6f335b046d93604c76", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1fcf9f6f335b046d93604c76", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Thanks for the kind words!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_3-667a8be3494a1beeded28bec", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:58:33.064873+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "667a8be3494a1beeded28bec", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "667a8be3494a1beeded28bec", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Gotta run bye!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_3-af117b017e9fc1f0fa62c128", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:58:33.079012+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "af117b017e9fc1f0fa62c128", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "af117b017e9fc1f0fa62c128", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: See you soon!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_3-16c177a828986ccf5e632c72", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:58:33.092120+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "16c177a828986ccf5e632c72", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "16c177a828986ccf5e632c72", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
